 "discovery_notes": "B411 follow-up 10 of B004 (DLR LE 2019). 26 standard searches. New: Medieval Magic collection (June 6, 2019 Pin Trading Night at DCA) - 8 single pins plus Prince and the Pauper 5-pin set, Sword in the Stone set, Brave Little Tailor set and Disney Dragons mystery (10, designs unnamed, held). Hanukkah 2019 dlr variant note. Named gaps (Tape #2-#4, Club 33 #2/#4/#5, WoM #8/#11, 2-1B) not resolved. No holds released."
}
